{"v":[{"a":["عَبَسَ","وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ"],"t":"He frowned and turned away","l":"Abasa Wa Tawalla","w":[["ʿabasa","He frowned"],["watawallā","and turned away"]]},{"a":["أَن","جَآءَهُ","ٱلۡأَعۡمَىٰ"],"t":"When the blind man approached him","l":"An Ja'ahu Al-'A`ma","w":[["an","Because"],["jāahu","came to him"],["l-aʿmā","the blind man"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","يُدۡرِيكَ","لَعَلَّهُۥ","يَزَّكَّىٰٓ"],"t":"But how do you know? Perhaps he was seeking to purify himself","l":"Wa Ma Yudrika La`allahu Yazzakka","w":[["wamā","But what"],["yud'rīka","would make you know"],["laʿallahu","that he might"],["yazzakkā","purify himself"]]},{"a":["أَوۡ","يَذَّكَّرُ","فَتَنفَعَهُ","ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰٓ"],"t":"Or be reminded, and the message would benefit him","l":"Aw Yadhakkaru Fatanfa`ahu Adh-Dhikra","w":[["aw","Or"],["yadhakkaru","be reminded"],["fatanfaʿahu","so would benefit him"],["l-dhik'rā","the reminder"]]},{"a":["أَمَّا","مَنِ","ٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰ"],"t":"But as for him who was indifferent","l":"Amma Mani Astaghna","w":[["ammā","As for"],["mani","(him) who"],["is'taghnā","considers himself free from need"]]},{"a":["فَأَنتَ","لَهُۥ","تَصَدَّىٰ"],"t":"You gave him your attention","l":"Fa'anta Lahu Tasadda","w":[["fa-anta","So you"],["lahu","to him"],["taṣaddā","give attention"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","عَلَيۡكَ","أَلَّا","يَزَّكَّىٰ"],"t":"Though you are not liable if he does not purify himself","l":"Wa Ma `Alayka 'Alla Yazzakka","w":[["wamā","And not"],["ʿalayka","upon you"],["allā","that not"],["yazzakkā","he purifies himself"]]},{"a":["وَأَمَّا","مَن","جَآءَكَ","يَسۡعَىٰ"],"t":"But as for him who came to you seeking","l":"Wa 'Amma Man Ja'aka Yas`a","w":[["wa-ammā","But as for"],["man","(he) who"],["jāaka","came to you"],["yasʿā","striving"]]},{"a":["وَهُوَ","يَخۡشَىٰ"],"t":"In awe","l":"Wa Huwa Yakhsha","w":[["wahuwa","While he"],["yakhshā","fears"]]},{"a":["فَأَنتَ","عَنۡهُ","تَلَهَّىٰ"],"t":"To him you were inattentive","l":"Fa'anta `Anhu Talahha","w":[["fa-anta","But you"],["ʿanhu","from him"],["talahhā","(are) distracted"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِنَّهَا","تَذۡكِرَةٞ"],"t":"Do not. This is a Lesson","l":"Kalla 'Innaha Tadhkirahun","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["innahā","Indeed, it"],["tadhkiratun","(is) a reminder"]]},{"a":["فَمَن","شَآءَ","ذَكَرَهُۥ"],"t":"Whoever wills, shall remember it","l":"Faman Sha'a Dhakarahu","w":[["faman","So whosoever"],["shāa","wills"],["dhakarahu","may remember it"]]},{"a":["فِي","صُحُفٖ","مُّكَرَّمَةٖ"],"t":"On honorable pages","l":"Fi Suhufin Mukarramahin","w":[["fī","In"],["ṣuḥufin","sheets"],["mukarramatin","honored"]]},{"a":["مَّرۡفُوعَةٖ","مُّطَهَّرَةِۭ"],"t":"Exalted and purified","l":"Marfu`atin Mutahharahin","w":[["marfūʿatin","Exalted"],["muṭahharatin","purified"]]},{"a":["بِأَيۡدِي","سَفَرَةٖ"],"t":"By the hands of scribes","l":"Bi'aydi Safarahin","w":[["bi-aydī","In (the) hands"],["safaratin","(of) scribes"]]},{"a":["كِرَامِۭ","بَرَرَةٖ"],"t":"Noble and devoted","l":"Kiramin Bararahin","w":[["kirāmin","Noble"],["bararatin","dutiful"]]},{"a":["قُتِلَ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","مَآ","أَكۡفَرَهُۥ"],"t":"Perish man! How thankless he is","l":"Qutila Al-'Insanu Ma 'Akfarahu","w":[["qutila","Is destroyed"],["l-insānu","[the] man"],["mā","how"],["akfarahu","ungrateful is he"]]},{"a":["مِنۡ","أَيِّ","شَيۡءٍ","خَلَقَهُۥ"],"t":"From what did He create him","l":"Min 'Ayyi Shay'in Khalaqahu","w":[["min","From"],["ayyi","what"],["shayin","thing"],["khalaqahu","He created him"]]},{"a":["مِن","نُّطۡفَةٍ","خَلَقَهُۥ","فَقَدَّرَهُۥ"],"t":"From a sperm drop He created him, and enabled him","l":"Min Nutfatin Khalaqahu Faqaddarahu","w":[["min","From"],["nuṭ'fatin","a semen-drop"],["khalaqahu","He created him"],["faqaddarahu","then He proportioned him"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","ٱلسَّبِيلَ","يَسَّرَهُۥ"],"t":"Then He eased the way for him","l":"Thumma As-Sabila Yassarahu","w":[["thumma","Then"],["l-sabīla","the way"],["yassarahu","He made easy for him"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","أَمَاتَهُۥ","فَأَقۡبَرَهُۥ"],"t":"Then He puts him to death, and buries him","l":"Thumma 'Amatahu Fa'aqbarahu","w":[["thumma","Then"],["amātahu","He causes him to die"],["fa-aqbarahu","and provides a grave for him"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","إِذَا","شَآءَ","أَنشَرَهُۥ"],"t":"Then, when He wills, He will resurrect him","l":"Thumma 'Idha Sha'a 'Ansharahu","w":[["thumma","Then"],["idhā","when"],["shāa","He wills"],["ansharahu","He will resurrect him"]]},{"a":["كَلَّا","لَمَّا","يَقۡضِ","مَآ","أَمَرَهُۥ"],"t":"But no, he did not fulfill what He has commanded him","l":"Kalla Lamma Yaqđi Ma 'Amarahu","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["lammā","Not"],["yaqḍi","he has accomplished"],["mā","what"],["amarahu","He commanded him"]]},{"a":["فَلۡيَنظُرِ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","إِلَىٰ","طَعَامِهِۦٓ"],"t":"Let man consider his food","l":"Falyanzuri Al-'Insanu 'Ila Ta`amihi","w":[["falyanẓuri","Then let look"],["l-insānu","the man"],["ilā","at"],["ṭaʿāmihi","his food"]]},{"a":["أَنَّا","صَبَبۡنَا","ٱلۡمَآءَ","صَبّٗا"],"t":"We pour down water in abundance","l":"Anna Sababna Al-Ma'a Sabbaan","w":[["annā","That [We]"],["ṣababnā","[We] poured"],["l-māa","the water"],["ṣabban","(in) abundance"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","شَقَقۡنَا","ٱلۡأَرۡضَ","شَقّٗا"],"t":"Then crack the soil open","l":"Thumma Shaqaqna Al-'Arđa Shaqqaan","w":[["thumma","Then"],["shaqaqnā","We cleaved"],["l-arḍa","the earth"],["shaqqan","splitting"]]},{"a":["فَأَنۢبَتۡنَا","فِيهَا","حَبّٗا"],"t":"And grow in it grains","l":"Fa'anbatna Fiha Habbaan","w":[["fa-anbatnā","Then We caused to grow"],["fīhā","therein"],["ḥabban","grain"]]},{"a":["وَعِنَبٗا","وَقَضۡبٗا"],"t":"And grapes and herbs","l":"Wa `Inabaan Wa Qađbaan","w":[["waʿinaban","And grapes"],["waqaḍban","and green fodder"]]},{"a":["وَزَيۡتُونٗا","وَنَخۡلٗا"],"t":"And olives and dates","l":"Wa Zaytunaan Wa Nakhlaan","w":[["wazaytūnan","And olive"],["wanakhlan","and date-palms"]]},{"a":["وَحَدَآئِقَ","غُلۡبٗا"],"t":"And luscious gardens","l":"Wa Hada'iqa Ghulbaan","w":[["waḥadāiqa","And gardens"],["ghul'ban","(of) thick foliage"]]},{"a":["وَفَٰكِهَةٗ","وَأَبّٗا"],"t":"And fruits and vegetables","l":"Wa Fakihatan Wa 'Abbaan","w":[["wafākihatan","And fruits"],["wa-abban","and grass"]]},{"a":["مَّتَٰعٗا","لَّكُمۡ","وَلِأَنۡعَٰمِكُمۡ"],"t":"Enjoyment for you, and for your livestock","l":"Mata`aan Lakum Wa Li'an`amikum","w":[["matāʿan","(As) a provision"],["lakum","for you"],["wali-anʿāmikum","and for your cattle"]]},{"a":["فَإِذَا","جَآءَتِ","ٱلصَّآخَّةُ"],"t":"But when the Deafening Noise comes to pass","l":"Fa'idha Ja'ati As-Sakhkhahu","w":[["fa-idhā","But when"],["jāati","comes"],["l-ṣākhatu","the Deafening Blast"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَفِرُّ","ٱلۡمَرۡءُ","مِنۡ","أَخِيهِ"],"t":"The Day when a person will flee from his brother","l":"Yawma Yafirru Al-Mar'u Min 'Akhihi","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["yafirru","will flee"],["l-maru","a man"],["min","from"],["akhīhi","his brother"]]},{"a":["وَأُمِّهِۦ","وَأَبِيهِ"],"t":"And his mother and his father","l":"Wa 'Ummihi Wa 'Abihi","w":[["wa-ummihi","And his mother"],["wa-abīhi","and his father"]]},{"a":["وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ","وَبَنِيهِ"],"t":"And his consort and his children","l":"Wa Sahibatihi Wa Banihi","w":[["waṣāḥibatihi","And his wife"],["wabanīhi","and his children"]]},{"a":["لِكُلِّ","ٱمۡرِيٕٖ","مِّنۡهُمۡ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","شَأۡنٞ","يُغۡنِيهِ"],"t":"Every one of them, on that Day, will have enough to preoccupy him","l":"Likulli Amri'in Minhum Yawma'idhin Sha'nun Yughnihi","w":[["likulli","For every"],["im'ri-in","man"],["min'hum","among them"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["shanun","(will be) a matter"],["yugh'nīhi","occupying him"]]},{"a":["وُجُوهٞ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","مُّسۡفِرَةٞ"],"t":"Faces on that Day will be radiant","l":"Wujuhun Yawma'idhin Musfirahun","w":[["wujūhun","Faces"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["mus'firatun","(will be) bright"]]},{"a":["ضَاحِكَةٞ","مُّسۡتَبۡشِرَةٞ"],"t":"Laughing and rejoicing","l":"Đahikatun Mustabshirahun","w":[["ḍāḥikatun","Laughing"],["mus'tabshiratun","rejoicing at good news"]]},{"a":["وَوُجُوهٞ","يَوۡمَئِذٍ","عَلَيۡهَا","غَبَرَةٞ"],"t":"And Faces on that Day will be covered with misery","l":"Wa Wujuhun Yawma'idhin `Alayha Ghabarahun","w":[["wawujūhun","And faces"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["ʿalayhā","upon them"],["ghabaratun","(will be) dust"]]},{"a":["تَرۡهَقُهَا","قَتَرَةٌ"],"t":"Overwhelmed by remorse","l":"Tarhaquha Qatarahun","w":[["tarhaquhā","Will cover them"],["qataratun","darkness"]]},{"a":["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","هُمُ","ٱلۡكَفَرَةُ","ٱلۡفَجَرَةُ"],"t":"These are the faithless, the vicious","l":"Ula'ika Humu Al-Kafaratu Al-Fajarahu","w":[["ulāika","Those"],["humu","[they]"],["l-kafaratu","(are) the disbelievers"],["l-fajaratu","the wicked ones"]]}]}